# Generated media and caches are NOT committed. This mirrors the repository's
# policy for course films — the root .gitignore states "retain plans/reviews; do
# not commit generated media or caches" and lists these patterns, but scopes them
# to `youtube/**`, which does not cover this student path. Scoped here instead of
# editing shared config.
#
# The rendered master, the narration and the per-beat clips all ship in
# SankarRajeswari_Rithika_INFO7375_Week01_Video.zip. Everything needed to rebuild
# them from source is committed: beat_sheet.json, the components, and the scripts.
